      "id": "p1-1-chart",
      "type": "stat_chart",
      "narration": "Watch what one percent a day really does. Start at one. A month in, you are barely ahead of where you began. But stay on the curve, and by the end of the year, you are not twice as good. You are thirty seven times better. Slip one percent each day instead, and you fade toward nothing.",
